🎬 AD-VENTURE: “THE PREDICTIVE PROPHET”

Concept: AI catches fraud in real time before humans even notice it.
Team: 4 people
Duration: ~3 minutes
Format: Advertisement, not a normal skit.

👥 Characters

1. Ad Host / Narrator – energetic, sells the product


2. Employee – busy employee handling a transaction


3. The Predictive Prophet (AI) – dramatic/funny AI character


4. Fraudster – tries to make a suspicious transaction



🎭 Props

One laptop

One fake “TRANSACTION” paper

Sunglasses/hoodie for the Fraudster

A placard saying “PREDICTIVE PROPHET AI”

Optional: small alarm/buzzer sound



---

🎤 SCRIPT

0:00–0:20 — HOOK

Ad Host:
“Every second, thousands of transactions happen.”

Employee:
“Emails, transactions, reports… I have 100 things to check!”

Ad Host:
“But what if fraud could be detected… before it happens?”

Dramatic pause.

*AI Prophet enters slowly wearing sunglasses.

AI Prophet:
“Relax. I already saw it coming.”


---

0:20–1:00 — THE PROBLEM

Fraudster:
“Hmm… today looks like a perfect day for a suspicious transaction.”

Walks toward Employee.

Fraudster:
“Hello! I have a completely normal transaction.”

Employee:
“Okay, let me check…”

Starts typing slowly.

Employee:
“Transaction looks… normal?”

Fraudster:
“Exactly! Very normal. Nothing suspicious whatsoever.”

AI Prophet suddenly raises hand.

AI Prophet:
“STOP!”

Employee:
“What happened?”

AI Prophet:
“Three unusual signals detected.”

Fraudster:
“Three?!”

AI Prophet:
“Unusual amount. Unusual behaviour. Unusual timing.”

Fraudster:
“Okay… maybe four signals.”


---

1:00–1:45 — SELL THE AI

Ad Host:
“Introducing…”

Everyone turns toward AI Prophet.

All:
“THE PREDICTIVE PROPHET!”

Ad Host:
“An AI-powered solution that analyses patterns, detects anomalies and raises alerts in real time.”

Employee:
“So I don't have to manually check everything?”

AI Prophet:
“Exactly.”

Employee:
“It can identify suspicious behaviour?”

AI Prophet:
“Yes.”

Employee:
“Before the damage happens?”

AI Prophet:
“That's the point.”

Fraudster:
“So… you can actually predict me?”

AI Prophet:
“I don't predict people.”

Pause.

AI Prophet:
“I predict patterns.”


---

1:45–2:25 — HUMAN + AI

Ad Host:
“But AI isn't here to replace people.”

Employee:
“Then what's the point?”

AI Prophet:
“You bring the judgement.”

Employee:
“And you bring the intelligence?”

AI Prophet:
“Exactly.”

Ad Host:
“AI detects the signal. Humans make the decision.”

Employee:
“So instead of spending hours searching for problems…”

AI Prophet:
“You spend your time solving them.”

Fraudster:
“And what happens to me?”

AI Prophet:
“You get a very short meeting with Compliance.”

Everyone looks at Fraudster.

Fraudster:
“I suddenly have another appointment.”

Fraudster tries to leave.

AI Prophet:
“Appointment cancelled.”


---

🔥 2:25–3:00 — BIG FINISH

Ad Host:
“In today's world, waiting for fraud to happen isn't enough.”

Employee:
“Manual checking looks at what happened.”

AI Prophet:
“Predictive AI looks at what could happen next.”

Fraudster:
“And that's why I need a new career.”

Audience laugh.

Ad Host:
“So, don't just react.”

Employee:
“Don't just investigate.”

AI Prophet:
“Predict. Detect. Act.”

All four step forward.

ALL TOGETHER:

“THE PREDICTIVE PROPHET —
Because the best time to detect fraud…
is BEFORE it happens!”

AI Prophet:
“Your data has patterns.”

Employee:
“Your business has risks.”

Ad Host:
“And now…”

ALL:
“AI HAS THE ANSWERS!”

Freeze pose. End.


---

⭐ Why this can work well

It hits all the judging areas:

Emotion & Engagement: dramatic AI entrance + comedy

AI relevance: anomaly detection, pattern recognition, real-time alerts

Creativity: AI character as a “Prophet”

Teamwork: all 4 have substantial stage roles

Advertisement format: you're actually selling the concept, rather than just acting out a story

Clear message: “Predict. Detect. Act.”


One important thing

Don't perform it like a normal office skit. Make it look like you're launching a new AI product. The Ad Host should behave like a TV commercial presenter, and the AI Prophet should be exaggerated and memorable.

If you want maximum impact, I can also make this into a more hilarious + dramatic BNP-style corporate advertisement, with exact stage movements, background sound effects, entry/exit positions, and a killer 10-second opening.
